'''Fresh Catch''' (とれたてピッチピチ, ''Toretate Picchi Pichi'', '''Fresh Catch Pitchi-Pitch''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (L): The effect of this ability is increased by 30%.

